# ─── Frontend (Vite) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env and adjust. Every VITE_* value is compiled into the public
# JavaScript bundle -- never put a secret here.
#
# Leave VITE_API_URL empty to use same-origin requests, which is what both the
# dev server proxy and a standard single-host deployment expect.
VITE_API_URL=

# NOTE: the old VITE_ADMIN_EMAIL / VITE_ADMIN_PASSWORD entries have been
# removed. Admin credentials are no longer compiled into the client bundle.
# Create the admin account with `npm run create-admin` in server/ instead.
